{"about_the_game":"<strong>! Important: &quot;X&quot; key for selection and decision.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445210/extras/4cca95b0fa90f94f7d853ed2fbdde426.avif?t=1688347586\" width=512 height=462 /></span><br>The main character's name is &quot;boy,&quot; and he is about 15 years old.<br>The story takes place in Valley Street, a dark city where it never gets dark.<br>The &quot;boy&quot; lives in the space between buildings.<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445210/extras/444803de09000706d8c0d484aa9bbf64.avif?t=1688347586\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br>When the &quot;boy&quot; walks down an alley, a holograph appears and the &quot;girl&quot; invites him to a trip to a southern island.<br>The &quot;boy&quot; takes a part-time job to earn a little money to access the island.<br>This is a communication game where you can make contact with the &quot;girl&quot; through the screen.<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445210/extras/154e67499dced25bb79ce683a5fb75bc.avif?t=1688347586\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br>The finger-tip communication is done through the holographic screen,<br>This is an approach that has never been used in games before,<br>The &quot;boy&quot; and &quot;girl&quot; can draw together.<br>This may be the first attempt of its kind in the game world.<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445210/extras/e3854dee0e7128d85da7eef468326cd2.avif?t=1688347586\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br>Can the &quot;boy&quot; get along with the &quot;girl&quot;?<br>And will he be able to go to the southern island where &quot;girl&quot; lives?<br><br><br>Main features<br>Can be played with keyboard, mouse or controller.<br>The actions include &quot;run&quot;, &quot;walk&quot;, &quot;jump&quot;, etc. Just press the buttons according to the situation.<br>During the game, you can draw with GIRL.<br>Drawing is very difficult with a controller, so use the mouse.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445210/extras/7dd11d2fc28fdab52d262973ce150d7a.avif?t=1688347586\" width=512 height=384 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445210/extras/c57b908f1da47c9741b61229947b68ad.avif?t=1688347586\" width=512 height=384 /></span><br><br>The story continues in &quot;Imaginary girl -Sequel&quot;.<br>This game consists of two parts.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2445210?t=1688347586","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1688347586","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1688347586","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445210/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1688347586","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<strong>! Important: &quot;X&quot; key for selection and decision.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445210/extras/4cca95b0fa90f94f7d853ed2fbdde426.avif?t=1688347586\" width=512 height=462 /></span><br>The main character's name is &quot;boy,&quot; and he is about 15 years old.<br>The story takes place in Valley Street, a dark city where it never gets dark.<br>The &quot;boy&q